{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck of Memories blends a deckbuilding roguelite with an evocative tale about fading memories. Play as Joon, a lighthouse keeper reminiscing about life using a deck of cards \u2013 a handcrafted diary of treasured moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/fba9f169dddb8a0cf5fec28b4b9aafa8.avif?t=1773157005\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras_big/fba9f169dddb8a0cf5fec28b4b9aafa8.avif?t=1773157005 width=800 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/8f8db0bc275c751695175cdd63ca32e0.poster.avif?t=1773157005\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/8f8db0bc275c751695175cdd63ca32e0.webm?t=1773157005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/8f8db0bc275c751695175cdd63ca32e0.mp4?t=1773157005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each memory features card battles on an immersive diorama board. Master your tactical deckbuilding skills to overcome challenging encounters and recollect every detail. Your decisions each turn and a deep card crafting system help you enhance and refine your unique deck. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/d5faf309ba6ac5d536ab7c3a0d953613.avif?t=1773157005\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras_big/d5faf309ba6ac5d536ab7c3a0d953613.avif?t=1773157005 width=800 height=102 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/0a1e64188ef20052550c794765373bd9.poster.avif?t=1773157005\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/0a1e64188ef20052550c794765373bd9.webm?t=1773157005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/0a1e64188ef20052550c794765373bd9.mp4?t=1773157005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on atmospheric diorama boards where memories manifest as cards. Dive deeper into them by overcoming a great variety of scenarios and random events in this easy to learn, hard to master card battler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/87717bf5c5a17a2ecdb43774e431ef38.avif?t=1773157005\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras_big/87717bf5c5a17a2ecdb43774e431ef38.avif?t=1773157005 width=800 height=102 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/5326882e4d33390d19d64d63b3eb176d.poster.avif?t=1773157005\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/5326882e4d33390d19d64d63b3eb176d.webm?t=1773157005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/5326882e4d33390d19d64d63b3eb176d.mp4?t=1773157005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need a rest? Warm up by the fireplace in your cozy, rustic lighthouse. Tinker with cards at the crafting table, catalog your collection in a personal album, and set the mood with custom decorations. Unlock new card pieces, crafting tools, and curious collectibles for your cozy retreat.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/ed0957170fb4fb41c8d5bf16a9e8230a.avif?t=1773157005\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras_big/ed0957170fb4fb41c8d5bf16a9e8230a.avif?t=1773157005 width=800 height=102 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/fe49cdd789a695ff99257416b0b1442e.poster.avif?t=1773157005\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/fe49cdd789a695ff99257416b0b1442e.webm?t=1773157005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/fe49cdd789a695ff99257416b0b1442e.mp4?t=1773157005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start each run with a handful of basic cards and craft them into a powerful deck unique to you. <br><br>Level up your cards and upgrade your fragment pool to influence the types of fragments you'll receive. Unearth unique fragments and passive powers to further customize your playstyle. Mastering these dynamic elements will put your strategic skills to the test. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/49b4f462902ac4d8ba0bbde508453de0.avif?t=1773157005\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras_big/49b4f462902ac4d8ba0bbde508453de0.avif?t=1773157005 width=800 height=102 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/168c086414ad6c7529685a07bb0fec67.poster.avif?t=1773157005\" width=800 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/168c086414ad6c7529685a07bb0fec67.webm?t=1773157005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/168c086414ad6c7529685a07bb0fec67.mp4?t=1773157005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and combine synergistic card pieces to pull off game-breaking combos.  <br><br>With unmatched freedom and depth of customization, the crafting system gives you full control over your cards and abilities, supporting endless combinations and strategies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/ca823020d8785ff1ac74e177536c6c0f.avif?t=1773157005\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras_big/ca823020d8785ff1ac74e177536c6c0f.avif?t=1773157005 width=800 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different. Choose and craft different cards, encounter diverse enemies and bosses, and explore many possible strategies and deck archetypes. <br><br>Test your skills against additional, daringly difficult challenges for seasoned card players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/d44d4d904c8b0e70e2f21a893a168e03.webp?t=1773157005\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras_big/d44d4d904c8b0e70e2f21a893a168e03.avif?t=1773157005 width=800 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/ad837953356731853f0706719c2c69db.avif?t=1773157005\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras_big/ad837953356731853f0706719c2c69db.avif?t=1773157005 width=800 height=252 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Still deckbuilding:</strong> Deck of Memories is in active development \u2014 and you can be part of it! <br><br>To join the community, test the latest demo, and share your feedback, hop onto our Discord \u2014 we\u2019d love to see you there!  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3056570?t=1773157005","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773157005","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/1113ec8576c4cc09f19556c0c0edd3c7d7157bc6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773157005","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/1113ec8576c4cc09f19556c0c0edd3c7d7157bc6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773157005","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck of Memories blends a deckbuilding roguelite with an evocative tale about fading memories. Play as Joon, a lighthouse keeper reminiscing about life using a deck of cards \u2013 a handcrafted diary of treasured moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn