static.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/168c086414ad6c7529685a07bb0fec67.webm?t=1773157005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/168c086414ad6c7529685a07bb0fec67.mp4?t=1773157005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and combine synergistic card pieces to pull off game-breaking combos.  <br><br>With unmatched freedom and depth of customization, the crafting system gives you full control over your cards and abilities, supporting endless combinations and strategies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/ca823020d8785ff1ac74e177536c6c0f.avif?t=1773157005\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras_big/ca823020d8785ff1ac74e177536c6c0f.avif?t=1773157005 width=800 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different. Choose and craft different cards, encounter diverse enemies and bosses, and explore many possible strategies and deck archetypes. <br><br>Test your skills against additional, daringly difficult challenges for seasoned card players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/d44d4d904c8b0e70e2f21a893a168e03.webp?t=1773157005\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras_big/d44d4d904c8b0e70e2f21a893a168e03.avif?t=1773157005 width=800 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/ad837953356731853f0706719c2c69db.avif?t=1773157005\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras_big/ad837953356731853f0706719c2c69db.avif?t=1773157005 width=800 height=252 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Still deckbuilding:</strong> Deck of Memories is in active development \u2014 and you can be part of it! <br><br>To join the community, test the latest demo, and share your feedback, hop onto our Discord \u2014 we\u2019d love to see you there!  </p>","developers":["Sentiment Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/57d3a139ff994bd0b5e277b4a2ffbeb1d646196a/header.jpg?t=1773157005","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3056570/1557371844/15726c69a9cddc19c29a6329b5618a1dd00a5b20/1750971309/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749399334","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3056570/1557371844/15726c69a9cddc19c29a6329b5618a1dd00a5b20/1750971309/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749399334","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3056570/1557371844/15726c69a9cddc19c29a6329b5618a1dd00a5b20/1750971309/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749399334","id":257137684,"name":"Deck of Memories - Early Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257137684/def276b1a7e65df431e24bc7795241c9f5892bb3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749399334"}],"name":"Deck of Memories","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Sentiment Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","us